#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/gst10-libav.xml:29
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>GStreamer Libav</application> package contains "
"<application>GStreamer</application> plugins for "
"<application>Libav</application> (a fork of "
"<application>FFmpeg</application>)."
msgstr ""
"O pacote <application>GStreamer Libav</application> contém plug-ins "
"<application>GStreamer</application> para <application>Libav</application> "
"(uma bifurcação do <application>FFmpeg</application>)."

